#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Basics of Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-"
"estimation-qpe}"
msgstr ""
"3. Grundlagen der Quantenphasenschätzung (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-"
"estimation-qpe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given a unitary operation $U$, the QPE estimates $\\theta$ in $U\\vert\\psi "
"\\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ since $U$ is "
"unitary, all of its eigenvalues have a norm of 1.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gegeben eine unitäre Operation $U$, schätzt die QPE $\\theta$ in "
"$U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$; "
"da $U$ unitär ist, haben alle Eigenwerte den Betrag 1.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.1 Procedure {#31-procedure}"
msgstr "3.1 Vorgehen {#31-procedure}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup {#1-setup}"
msgstr "1. Aufbau {#1-setup}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is in one set of qubit registers. An additional set of"
" $n$ qubits form the counting register on which we will store the value "
"$2^n\\theta$:\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ befindet sich in einem Qubit-Register. Ein weiteres "
"Register aus $n$ Qubits bildet das Zählregister, in dem wir den Wert "
"$2^n\\theta$ speichern:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Superposition {#2-superposition}"
msgstr "2. Superposition {#2-superposition}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply a $n$-bit Hadamard gate operation $H^{\\otimes n}$ on the counting "
"register:\n"
msgstr ""
"Wende eine $n$-Bit-Hadamard-Gate-Operation $H^{\\otimes n}$ auf das "
"Zählregister an:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Controlled Unitary operations {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"
msgstr "3. Gesteuerte unitäre Operationen {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We need to introduce the controlled unitary $CU$ that applies the unitary "
"operator $U$ on the target register only if its corresponding control bit is"
" $|1\\rangle$. Since $U$ is a unitary operator with eigenvector "
"$|\\psi\\rangle$ such that $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} "
"\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, this means:\n"
msgstr ""
"Wir führen das gesteuerte Unitäre $CU$ ein, das den unitären Operator $U$ "
"auf das Zielregister anwendet, wenn das entsprechende Steuer-Bit "
"$|1\\rangle$ ist. Da $U$ ein unitärer Operator mit Eigenvektor "
"$|\\psi\\rangle$ ist, sodass $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} "
"\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, gilt:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.2 Example: T-gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"
msgstr "3.2 Beispiel: T-Gate-QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's use $T$ gate as an example of QPE and estimate its phase $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verwenden wir das $T$-Gate als Beispiel für die QPE und schätzen wir seine "
"Phase $\\theta$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We expect to find:\n"
msgstr "Wir erwarten:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where\n"
msgstr "wobei\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"We initialize $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ of the eigenvector of $T$ gate by applying an $X$ gate:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"Wir initialisieren $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ als Eigenvektor des $T$-Gates durch Anwendung eines $X$-Gates:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-"
"outputs/2334e6e2-7ae2-4d4c-9014-3e6041f37ee7-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
